EVALUATION.md §8.3: check names are unique within a record, within a case, and among the
package checks of a package; the second use is reported at its name.
-- teamboard/names.canon --
package teamboard

record Column {
  label: String

  check short: label.len() < 12 else "too long"
  check short: label != "" else "empty"
}

variant Reward {
  item {
    count: Int

    check positive: count > 0 else "no items"
    check positive: count < 100 else "too many"
  }
}

check deck: 1 == 1 else "a"
check deck: 2 == 2 else "b"
check other: 3 == 3 else "c"
-- findings.txt --
error[E5003]  teamboard/names.canon:7:9
  check name short is used twice in Column

error[E5003]  teamboard/names.canon:15:11
  check name positive is used twice in Reward.item

error[E5003]  teamboard/names.canon:20:7
  check name deck is used twice in teamboard

3 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
